 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In Pebble Creek, your last name is your superpower.",
   "tag": "[mysterious, warm]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Gardners grow pumpkins in a blink. Taylors sew suits in a sneeze.",
   "tag": "[playful]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Ezra Wilson had one of the most common names around. No Wilson ever found their power.",
   "tag": "[deadpan]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Brock Steele, who bent lamp posts, called him No-Power and dumped him in trash cans.",
   "tag": "[dry]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Once, a goose chased him.",
   "tag": "[amused]",
   "pause": 0.05
  },
  {
   "text": "“Dad!”",
   "speak": "Dad!",
   "voice": "ezra",
   "tag": "[panicked yell]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "And Dad was right there, holding the goose.",
   "tag": "[matter-of-fact]",
   "pause": 0.05
  },
  {
   "text": "“Just passing by.”",
   "speak": "Just passing by.",
   "voice": "dad",
   "tag": "[casual]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Lost in a corn maze, Ezra whispered it, and Dad tapped his shoulder.",
   "tag": "[curious]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Dad was the principal, always around.",
   "tag": "[shrugging]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "One Saturday, Brock cornered him behind the arcade and knotted a stop sign.",
   "tag": "[ominous]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“No teachers. No friends. No power.”",
   "speak": "No teachers. No friends. No power.",
   "voice": "brock",
   "tag": "[menacing, mocking]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“Dad?”",
   "speak": "Dad?",
   "voice": "ezra",
   "tag": "[scared whisper]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Poof. Dad appeared between them in a frilly apron, a pancake still flipping.",
   "tag": "[surprised, comic]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Wilson means Will's son. A son in real trouble can always call his dad.",
   "tag": "[realizing, warm]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“Mister Steele. My office, Monday, six a.m. Bring your grandma.”",
   "speak": "Mister Steele. My office, Monday, six A M. Bring your grandma.",
   "voice": "dad",
   "tag": "[calm, stern]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“That's cheating!”",
   "speak": "That's cheating!",
   "voice": "brock",
   "tag": "[outraged]",
   "pause": 0.05
  },
  {
   "text": "“Nope. Just my last name.”",
   "speak": "Nope. Just my last name.",
   "voice": "ezra",
   "tag": "[shrugging, cheeky]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“DAD!”",
   "speak": "DAD!",
   "voice": "brock",
   "tag": "[desperate shout]",
   "pause": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing. Steele isn't a son's name.",
   "tag": "[deadpan]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Now Brock waves every morning.",
   "tag": "[warm, amused]",
   "pause": 0.05
  },
  {
   "text": "“Morning, Ezra. Tell your dad hi!”",
   "speak": "Morning, Ezra. Tell your dad hi!",
   "voice": "brock",
   "tag": "[nervous, overly polite]",
   "pause": 0.08
  }
 ],
